      <link>https://www.ouest-france.fr/environnement/pesticides/petition-duplomb-six-mois-plus-tard-le-debat-se-tient-a-lassemblee-32794484-0700-11f1-9c0a-f496d01f0cae?utm_source=fluxpublicfrance&amp;utm_medium=fluxrss&amp;utm_campaign=banquedecontenu</link>
